purchases </span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px;\\\">check all the processes and that everthing is calculated truely</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px; text-align: start;\\\">move footer bottom</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px; text-align: start;\\\">remove customer group from sales rep creation </span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px; text-align: start;\\\"><br></span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px;\\\"><br></span><br></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\">in product transfer filter branch should be from and to </font></span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\">Check that reports are done successfully </font></span></p><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">add salesProduct-report pharmacy</span></div><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">add nothing to selects in filter </span></div><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">in branches set inputs to title phone and city </span></div><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">in /pharmacist link branch and customer group </span></div><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">add first option select </span></div><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">add debit limit as input in pharmacist</span></div><div><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">active should be optional </span></div