 mobile phones, tablets, and computers.\\r\\n\\r\\nMultilingual Support: Support for multiple languages (Arabic - English) to meet the needs of visitors from various nationalities.\\r\\n\\r\\nControl Panel: An easy-to-use control panel that allows you to manage and update website content effortlessly.\\r\\n\\r\\nSocial Media Integration: Integration with the medicines company\\\'s social media accounts to enhance communication with clients.\\r\\n\\r\\nUnlimited Email Addresses: Ability to add an unlimited number of company email addresses.\\r\\n\\r\\nFree Domain for One Year: We provide a free domain for the first year.\\r\\n\\r\\nFree Hosting for One Year: Free hosting for the website for one year to ensure stable and reliable operation.\\r\\n\\r\\nTechnical Support for One Year: Continuous technical support for one year to resolve any issues or inquiries.\\r\\n\\r\\nOrder Management: A comprehensive system for managing customer orders, including order tracking and status updates.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail Order Confirmations: Automatic email confirmations for customers after placing an order.\\r\\n\\r\\nOnline Payment Integration: Secure online payment methods to facilitate easy and safe transactions.\\r\\n\\r\\nWebsite Contents\\r\\n\\r\\nHome Page: Contains an introduction to the company, latest news, and special product offers.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"About Us\\\" Page: Detailed information about the company\\\'s history, mission, and goals.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Contact Us\\\" Page: A simple contact form for visitors to send emails directly to the company, along with complete contact information.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Products\\\" Page: Comprehensive information about the different medicines and products offered by the company, with the option to purchase online.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Services\\\" Page: A showcase of all the services available, including distribution, consultations, and more.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Cart and Orders\\\" Page: A dedicated page for customers to view their shopping cart, manage their orders, and track order statuses.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe are committed to providing a website that reflects the professionalism of the medicines company and offers an excellent user experience. Our goal is to support you with the best tools to manage and enhance your online presence, with a focus on seamless e-commerce integration.\', `created_at` = \'2024-07-17 00:32:08\', `id` = \'8\', `isOverthinking` = \'0\', `script` = \'\', `title` = \'Offers\', `updated_at` = \'2025-07-13 05:58:06\'\r\n                WHERE id = 8;\r\n            \r\n','2025-07-13 19:05:39','2025-07-13 19:05:39'),(802,'\r\n                UPDATE yousabte_workspace.issues\r\n                SET `codeLinks` = \'72000 02/06/2025\', `created_at` = \'2024-07-17 00:33:46\', `id` = \'9\', `isOverthinking` = \'0\', `script` = \'\', `title` = \'Ibrahim Account\', `updated_at` = \'2025-07-13 05:58:06\'\r\n                WHERE id = 9;\r\n            \r\n','2025-07-13 19:05:39','2025-07-13 19:05:39'),(803,'\r\n                UPDATE yousabte_workspace.issues\r\n                SET `codeLinks` = \'start https://www.facebook.com/share/p/cc6Wd1ojQyGDhZGK/?mibextid=xfxF2i\\r\\nstart \\r\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/p/V9j4ugETnrkE6QJP/?mibextid=oFDknk\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/share/ZPzi2wtzTkML1CEw/?mibextid=oFDknk\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/YousabTech?mibextid=ZbWKwL\\r\\nstart http://localhost/yousab-tech/public/en\\r\\nstart https://yousab-tech.com/webapp/public/en\\r\\nstart https://www.instagram.com/\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/infinity.digital.master?mibextid\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/solu.eg?mibextid=ZbWKwL\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/fassla.software?mibextid=ZbWKwL\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/markattybusiness?mibextid=ZbWKwL\\r\\nstart https://www.facebook.com/Diturn.net?mibextid=ZbWKwL\', `created_at` = \'2024-07-17 00:57:20\', `id` = \'14\', `isOverthinking` = \'0\', `script` = \'\', `title` = \'Competitors\', `updated_at` = \'2025-07-13 05:58:06\'\r\n                WHERE id = 14;\r\n            \r\n','2025-07-13 19:05:39','2025-07-13 19:05:39'),(804,'\r\n                UPDATE yousabte_workspace.issues\r\n                SET `codeLinks` = \'import React, { useState } from \\\'react\\\';\\r\\nimport axios from \\\'axios\\\';\\r\\nimport { toast, ToastContainer } from \\\'react-toastify\\\';\\r\\nimport \\\'react-toastify/dist/ReactToastify.css\\\';\\r\\n\\r\\nconst ContactUs = () => {\\r\\n    const [formData, setFormData] = useState({\\r\\n        demo: \\\'\\\',\\r\\n    });\\r\\n    \\r\\n    const [errors, setErrors] = useState({\\r\\n        demo: \\\'\\\',\\r\\n    });\\r\\n\\r\\n    const handleChange = (e) => {\\r\\n        const { id, value } = e.target;\\r\\n        setFormData({ ...formData, [name]: value });\\r\\n    };\\r\\n\\r\\n    const handleSubmit = async (e) => {\\r\\n        e.preventDefault();\\r\\n\\r\\n        try {\\r\\n            await axios.post(\\\'https://yousab-tech.com/academy/public/api/message\\\', formData);\\r\\n            toast.success(\\\'Message sent successfully!\\\');\\r\\n            setFormData({\\r\\n                demo: \\\'\\\',\\r\\n            });\\r\\n            setErrors({\\r\\n                demo: \\\'\\\',\\r\\n            });\\r\\n        } catch (error) {\\r\\n            if (error.response && error.response.data && error.response.data.data) {\\r\\n                const apiErrors = error.response.data.data;\\r\\n                setErrors({\\r\\n                    demo: apiErrors.demo ? apiErrors.demo.join(\\\'\\\\n\\\') : \\\'\\\',\\r\\n                });\\r\\n                toast.error(\\\'Error sending message. Please check your inputs.\\\');\\r\\n            } else {\\r\\n                toast.error(\\\'Error sending message. Please try again later.\\\');\\r\\n            }\\r\\n        }\\r\\n    };\\r\\n\\r\\n    return (\\r\\n        <div className=\\\"container-fluid py-5\\\">\\r\\n            <div className=\\\"container py-5\\\">\\r\\n                <div className=\\\"text-center mb-5\\\">\\r\\n                    <h5 className=\\\"text-primary text-uppercase mb-3\\\" style={{ letterSpacing: \\\'5px\\\' }}>اتصال</h5>\\r\\n                    <h1>الاتصال للحصول على أي استفسار</h1>\\r\\n                </div>\\r\\n                <div className=\\\"row justify-content-center\\\">\\r\\n                    <div className=\\\"col-lg-8\\\">\\r\\n                        <div className=\\\"contact-form bg-secondary rounded p-5\\\">\\r\\n                            <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\\r\\n                                <div className=\\\"control-group mb-3\\\">\\r\\n                                    <input \\r\\n                                        type=\\\"text\\\" \\r\\n                                        className=\\\"form-control border-0 p-4\\\" \\r\\n                                        id=\\\"demo\\\" \\r\\n                                        name=\\\"demo\\\"\\r\\n                                        placeholder=\\\"demo\\\" \\r\\n                                        value={formData.demo}\\r\\n                                        onChange={handleChange}\\r\\n                                    />\\r\\n                                    <p className=\\\"help-block text-danger\\\" style={{ whiteSpace: \\\'pre-line\\\' }}>{errors.demo}</p>\\r\\n                                </div>\\r\\n                                <div className=\\\"text-center\\\">\\r\\n                                    <button className=\\\"btn btn-primary py-3 px-5\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">أرسل رسالة</button>\\r\\n                                </div>\\r\\n                            </form>\\r\\n                        </div>\\r\\n                    </div>\\r\\n                </div>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n\\r\\n            <ToastContainer\\r\\n                position=\\\"top-right\\\"\\r\\n                autoClose={5000}\\r\\n                hideProgressBar={false}\\r\\n                newestOnTop={false}\\r\\n                closeOnClick\\r\\n                rtl={false}\\r\\n                pauseOnFocusLoss\\r\\n                draggable\\r\\n                pauseOnHover\\r\\n            />\\r\\n        </div>\\r\\n    );\\r\\n};\\r\\n\\r\\nexport default ContactUs;\', `created_at` = \'2024-09-15 12:07:39\', `id` = \'15\', `isOverthinking` = \'0\', `script` = \'\', `title` = \'React Post\', `updated_at` = \'2025-07-13 05:58:06\'\r\n                WHERE id = 15;\r\n            \r\n','2025-07-13 19:05:39','2025-07-13 19:05:39'),(805,'\r\n                UPDATE yousabte_workspace.issues\r\n                SET `codeLinks` = \'import React, { useEffect, useState } from \\\'react\\\';\\r\\nimport { Link } from \\\'react-router-dom\\\';\\r\\n\\r\\nconst Courses = () => {\\r\\n    const [courses, setCourses] = useState([]);\\r\\n\\r\\n    // Fetching courses data from the API\\r\\n    useEffect(() => {\\r\\n        fetch(\\\'https://yousab-tech.com/academy/public/api/courses\\\')\\r\\n            .then((response) => response.json())\\r\\n            .then((data) => {\\r\\n                setCourses(data.data.courses);  // Assuming the courses are inside data.data.courses\\r\\n            })\\r\\n            .catch((error) => {\\r\\n                console.error(\\\'Error fetching courses:\\\', error);\\r\\n            });\\r\\n    }, []);\\r\\n\\r\\n    return (\\r\\n        <div className=\\\"container-fluid py-5\\\">\\r\\n            <div className=\\\"container py-5\\\">\\r\\n                <div className=\\\"text-center mb-5\\\">\\r\\n                    <h5 className=\\\"text-primary text-uppercase mb-3\\\" style={{ letterSpacing: \\\'5px\\\' }}>Courses</h5>\\r\\n                    <h1>Available Courses</h1>\\r\\n                </div>\\r\\n                <div className=\\\"row\\\">\\r\\n                    {courses.map((item) => (\\r\\n                        <div className=\\\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\\\" key=