INSERT INTO `scripts` (`id`, `script`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (2,'Learn everything website\r\nhttps://devdocs.io\r\nProblem Solving websites\r\nhttps://leetcode.com/problemset/all/ \r\nLaravel Packages\r\nAdmin lte dashboard frontend\r\nData table js (official website)\r\nChatify (official website)\r\nLaravel Eloquent Relationship(Try all of them)\r\nhttps://laravel.com/docs/10.x/eloquent-relationships#one-to-many-polymorphic-relations\r\nLaravel spatie(roles & permissions)\r\nhttps://www.itsolutionstuff.com/post/laravel-8-user-roles-and-permissions-tutorialexample.html\r\n\"astrotomic/laravel-translatable\": \"^11.9\", (github)\r\nhttps://docs.astrotomic.info/laravel-translatable\r\n\"mcamara/laravel-localization\": \"^1.6\", (github)\r\nhttps://github.com/mcamara/laravel-localization\r\nlightbox js\r\nhttps://lokeshdhakar.com/projects/lightbox2/ \r\nVoayger Laravel Dashboard\r\nAdvanced laravel topics:laraveldaily.com/post/advanced-laravel-20-topics-and-links-to-learn-them\r\npolymorphic-relationships //official laravel documentation\r\nhttps://laravel.com/docs/10.x/eloquent-relationships#one-to-one-polymorphic-relations\r\nimport excel in dashboard and save in database\r\nhttps://docs.laravel-excel.com/3.1/imports/basics.html\r\nhttps://dev.to/techtoolindia/import-excel-file-into-laravel-8-3kif\r\nMigration and seeder generator\r\nhttps://github.com/oscarafdev/migrations-generator\r\nsliders in different programming languages\r\nhttpsmml and listener\r\nhttps.lk.kocìjjdev.to/kingsconsult/laravel-8-events-and-listeners-with-practical-example-9m7\r\nlaravel and android complete project\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bATVPIPQ6dQ&list=PL0qWGthGFUCi52te8DRNi_If9KBLWZG49&index=14\r\napi and android greate working simple example\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MgEsNXwj0lY&t=324s\r\nvery beneficial php,ajax and jquery native forms source\r\nhttps://bootstrapfriendly.com/\r\nfree website templates\r\nhttps://www.free-css.com/\r\nQueue and job in laravel\r\nhttps://magecomp.com/blog/implement-queue-laravel-8/\r\ncities,countries/province free api\r\nhttps://www.universal-tutorial.com/rest-apis/free-rest-api-for-country-state-city  \r\nbootstrap links\r\nhttps://cdnjs.com\r\nLaravel community\r\nhttps://laravel-news.com/\r\nTo get info about any package such as requirements\r\nhttps://packagist.org/\r\nLaravel Cart Package\r\nhttps://jackiedo.github.io/Laravel-Cart/#/installation\r\nAnother Laravel Cart Package\r\nhttps://www.larablocks.com/package/darryldecode/cart\r\nSend email with attachment\r\nhttps://www.itsolutionstuff.com/post/how-to-send-email-with-attachment-in-laravelexample.html\r\nhttps://www.laravelia.com/post/laravel-10-attach-file-to-email-from-storage-example\r\nLaravel desktop app native php/electron\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/posts/mohamed-samy-9a1a6b16b_php-laravel-activity-7093179614721695745-PAaT?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_android\r\n\r\nLaravel 10 Social Media Share\r\nhttps://www.positronx.io/laravel-social-media-share-buttons-integration-tutorial/\r\nLaravel project to flutter\r\nhttps://dev.to/3x1io/generate-a-flutter-app-from-your-tomato-app-2d5p?fbclid=IwAR3cZWeX3OJgudTWdy3ajGzTlnukYBrsjnZldtPnCcCVFgDsLGcMgYKRmh8\r\n\r\nLaravel Telescope\r\nLaravel Excel\r\nLaravel Media Library\r\nLaravel Nova\r\nLaravel Backback\r\nLaravel Debugger\r\nLaravel Scout\r\nLaravel Passport\r\nLaravel Spatie Permissions\r\nLaravel Horizons\r\n\r\nWebsite to get images content for websites (VERY IMPORTANT)\r\nhttps://yandex.com/images \r\nLaravel request() methods\r\nhttps://laravel.com/docs/10.x/requests\r\n//Search inside select options\r\nhttps://www.jqueryscript.net/form/select-box-search-option.html#:~:text=Just%20attatch%20the%20function%20searchBox,plugin%20will%20do%20the%20rest.&text=%24(%20\'.,searchBox()%3B \r\n\r\n\r\n','2024-02-09 01:45:48','2024-02-09 01:45:48'),(3,'Debug Reference\r\nSite Translations\r\nRequests and Emails\r\nPhone and email alignment\r\nIdentity and CopyRights\r\nRef to Marwan Site\r\nResponsive and RTL\r\nSeeders to all data in website\r\nApply all requirements\r\nRemove unused modules\r\njQuery disables when send buttons\r\nUsed pages(‘identifier’) when retrieving pages in site\r\nSuitable Validation\r\nBlades design\r\nSettings\r\nSide menu\r\nServer and local database and files similarity\r\nDelete files on(delete, update, cascade)\r\nLang toggle icons or flags\r\nBreadcrump accuracy\r\nAnimations\r\nTransition and scale\r\nWhatsapp fixed\r\naccept in files html\r\n__blank for all external links\r\nfooter 4 sections content\r\nfixed card sizes\r\nreturn active objects only\r\nDelete consoles.log\r\nslider 100 vh\r\napplying take(3) as needed\r\nmail credentials in env local and server\r\nfrom and to emails in settings\r\n','2024-02-09 01:45:48','2024-02-09 01:45:48'),(4,'Very important laravel extensions\r\nlaravel go to view\r\nlaravel go to controller\r\nlaravel go to lang\r\nlaravel Goto\r\nlaravel go to path\r\ntabnine\r\nRainbow Brackets2\r\ncolor the tag name\r\nRainbow Tags\r\nclear cache chrome \r\nlaravel spelling\r\nPesticides Chrome Extension\r\nVscode Google Translate //Alt+shift+t\r\nLive Server\r\nGoogle documents driver app\r\nLorem Ipsum\r\nArabic Lorem Ipsum\r\nFirefox: Eyedropper\r\nFocus on first input (keyboard shortcut)\r\nOpen Multiple URLs\r\nJSON Viewer\r\nCapitalize\r\nOpen all files in directory\r\nRemember Open Files\r\nOpen Matching Files\r\nOpen Files  [ctrl+alt+r] //open related files\r\nFind extension to open jobs and freelancing sites \r\nAuto Rename Tag //vscode extension\r\nForm Vault //to save forms data and reset them when needed\r\nCSS Peek //Jump to css file\r\nBootstrap 5 Quick Snippets //bootstrap helper \r\nIntelliSense for CSS class names in HTML\r\nUndoClose // Desktop app to open recently closed apps and folders\r\nNavigate pages with a text cursor\r\ngoogle translate chrome extension\r\nBootstrap 5 & Font Awesome Snippets\r\nPutty //for ssh (ssh = terminal)\r\nSave image as type\r\nBlack Box to copy text from video\r\nPoe.com //chatgpt for filling websites content\r\nsublime mark\r\nexport your extensions\r\nshowHtml\r\nQuick and Simple Text Selection  //important for multiselect diregard to how many part these items has\r\nSearch Editor: Apply Changes //used to apply changes from search editor directly\r\nMultiple cursor case preserve\r\nCursor Align\r\nWappalyzer\r\n\r\n\r\n','2024-02-09 01:45:48','2024-02-09 01:45:48'),(5,'How to control database from cmd (terminal)\r\ncd xampp/mysql/bin\r\nmysql -u root -p\r\nuse DBname;\r\nshow columns in tableName = desc tableName;\r\nSHOW CREATE TABLE table_name;\r\nselect * from INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLE_CONSTRAINTS;\r\nselect * from INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLE_CONSTRAINTS where table_schema=\'employment\' and table_name=\"jobs\";\r\nIMPORT DATABASE\r\nmysql -u root -p \"alogla_w\" < C:\\Users\\pc\\Desktop\\alogla\\alogla_w.sql\"\r\nALTER TABLE old_table_name RENAME new_table_name; //to rename table from cmd\r\nALTER TABLE comments change recipe_id news_id bigint();//to rename column from cmd\r\n\r\n','2024-02-09 01:45:48','2024-02-09 01:45:48'),(6,'How to make cmd (terminal) accept arabic\r\nchcp 1256\r\n\r\n','2024-02-09 01:45:48','2024-02-09 01:45:48'),(7,'How to use ssh in git bash\r\nssh serverusername@serverip then insert server password\r\n\r\n','2024-02-09 01:45:48','2024-02-09 01:45:48'),(8,'Important shortcuts\r\nctrl+tab & ctrl+shift+tab //to go between files in a folder\r\nctrl+shift+f //to search for some statement in all files\r\nctrl+shift+f+book icon used //to search for some statement in opened files only\r\nctrl+shift+h //to replace some statement in all files\r\nctrl+f2 //to determine a searched word\r\nctrl+L //to determine a line\r\nctrl+shift+t //to restore tabs\r\nctrl+D //and move to select multiple in between codes\r\nCtrl+u //cursor undo and works like ctrl+z to return cursor selection when missed\r\nctrl+c, ctrl+x, ctrl+v, ctrl+z, ctrl+y, ctrl+a, ctrl+f\r\nctrl+B //to bold text\r\nctrl+p or ctrl+e //to search for file in a folder vscode\r\nctrl+e //to rename file or folder\r\nCTRL+SHIFT+P & \"Developer: reload window\"\r\nctrl+shift+v //paste without format\r\nctrl+space //shows recommendations\r\nctrl+enter // to go in phpmyadmin\r\nctrl+f //find\r\nCtrl+h //replace\r\nCtrl+shift+R //reload and clear cache\r\nCtrl+D //add bookmark\r\nCtrl +shift + D // add bookmark folder\r\nCtrl+shift+delete //show controls\r\nctrl+N //new window\r\nctrl+t //new tab\r\nctrl+w // close tab in apps that has tabs and close window in those who does not have tabs but we need to use Alt+tab before it to work\r\nctrl+shift+w //close window and = Alt+f4\r\nCtrl+R //Reload\r\nctrl+B //to full screen in vscode\r\nctrl+arrow right and control+arrow left //to minimize and maximize folders in vscode side menu\r\nctrl+D //can magically determine the specific word I want to use after auto determined\r\nCtrl+D and ctrl+shift+D // to move inside code\r\nctrl+shift+c //open inspect and =f12\r\nctrl+shift+o //open bookmarks page\r\nctrl+shift+c //to open terminal from inside vscode\r\nctrl+shift+x //for extensions in vscode\r\nctrl+arrow up and ctrl+arrow down to move inside terminal\r\nctrl+j //to show and hide terminal in vscode\r\nctrl+w //can close anything\r\nctrl+shift+e //to show files list in vscode sidebar\r\nctrl+shift+g g //to show source control in vscode sidebar\r\nctrl+k+w // to close all files in vscode\r\nctrl+shift+A //to navigate between tabs in chrome\r\nctrl+arrow left and ctrl+arrow right //to skip by one word\r\nctrl+shift+arrow right and ctrl+shift+arrow left //to determine sentence word by word\r\nctrl+arrow up and arrow down //move me through file without moving cursor while arrow up and arrow down without\r\nctrl //move cursor\r\nctrl+arrow left //collapse side list in vscode\r\nctrl+right click //open in new tab\r\nCtrl+backspace //delete word by word\r\nCtrl+shift+pageup and pagedown //nav chrome tabs\r\nCtrl+k+s //show all shortcuts and extens